@@ -0,0 +1,8 @@
+# Boost: blog links in the user profile
+
+When blogs are enabled, the Miscellaneous section of the user profile now shows two blog links:
+
+* **View my blog entries** (previously "Blog entries"): opens the viewed user's own blog entries.
+* **View site blog entries**: opens the site-wide blog listing (/blog/index.php).
+
+Both links are displayed wherever the blog link was previously displayed, and neither is shown when blogs are disabled. Blog permissions and page behaviour are unchanged.
